==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|tólf}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*twalif}}. Compare Faroese {{m|fo|tólv}}, Norwegian, Swedish, and Danish {{m|no|tolv}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''tólf'''

# '''[[twelve]]'''; the cardinal number after [[ellefu#Icelandic|ellefu]] and before [[þrettán#Icelandic|þrettán]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[tólfti]] {{g|m}}, [[tólfta]] {{g|f|n}}

====Derived terms====
* [[klukkan tólf]]

